#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Z.ai (optional)"
msgstr "Z.ai (opsional)"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"A Z.ai Coding Plan key adds the quota windows (5-hour, weekly, monthly) and the last 7 and 30 days of usage to the popup."
msgstr ""
"Kunci Z.ai Coding Plan menambahkan jendela kuota (5 jam, mingguan, bulanan) serta penggunaan 7 dan 30 hari terakhir ke popup."

